Fredtalk Shots 2.0.0
Copyright (c) 2026 Fred

The package contains the Fredtalk report workflow, local media measurement
engine, validation rules, analysis references and reproduction-prompt template.
The 2.0 engine and regression suites were newly implemented from the report
input contract using Python standard-library facilities.

Python, FFmpeg and ffprobe are separately distributed runtime tools.
Their names describe real dependencies; this package does not claim authorship
of those tools or of video content supplied for analysis.
No external Skill package is required at runtime.
